WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.790
One line lands.

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:04.990
Fix the onboarding flow, and ship it when ready.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.680
Your agent pounces.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:09.080
Ten tasks, all at once.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.790
It invents a target nobody measured.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.480
It hears ship it as a yes.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:24.090
Intent to Plan starts by pulling the request apart.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:30.210
Five threads: why, who, what, how, when.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.390
Each marked said, inferred or open.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.890
Then it weaves the order.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:39.410
Inspect, decide, build, verify.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.090
Every handoff names what crosses.

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:44.620
The verdict is revise.

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:48.460
The baseline is missing, and the release still needs an owner.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.790
Its optional compiler is a prototype.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.760
Check the order before you run anything.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:05.950
Intent to Plan.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:10.270
Turn a complex request into a plan you can test and hand over.
